p={'version':1,'registered_before_pnl':True,'assets':'BTC ETH SOL XRP DOGE ADA LINK LTC AVAX DOT BCH TON NEAR SUI APT TRX'.split(),'configs':configs,'configuration_count':len(configs),'raw_bar':'15m','signal_bar':'closed UTC 1H, 4 consecutive confirmed 15m','raw_start':'2026-07-05T00:00:00Z','start':'2026-07-10T00:00:00Z','end':'2026-10-05T00:00:00Z','periods':{'development':['2026-07-10','2026-08-15'],'validation':['2026-08-15','2026-09-10'],'confirmation':['2026-09-10','2026-10-05']},'period_warning':'retrospective temporal splits only; some prices/spot regimes already seen; not blind or future paper evidence','initial':500.,'target':650.,'stop_equity':250.,'maintenance_proxy_rate':.02,'liquidation_proxy_fee':.002,'entry_allocation':.95,'costs':{'SPOT':{'base':{'fee':.001,'slip':.0005},'stress':{'fee':.002,'slip':.001}},'CONDITIONAL_SWAP':{'base':{'fee':.0005,'slip':.0005},'stress':{'fee':.001,'slip':.001}}},'episode_schedule':'For each period, UTC midnight daily starts for 24h; every 7 days anchored period start for 168h. Require full horizon inside that period. 16 separate coin accounts per start. No overlapping same-coin windows per horizon. Different configs, coins and horizons correlated alternatives, not independent statistical samples. No pooled bankroll.','entry':'One trade maximum. First available closed-hour signal at/after episode start, execute same boundary next15m open. Spot only long; ignore short. No same-bar close data in entry decision. Warmup120hours. EMA first-close seeded then recursion, RSI simple rolling mean gains/losses (Cutler) not Wilder.','rules':'Donchian cross outside previous n high/low; EMA actual cross; momentum cross +threshold/-threshold; Boll reentry from outside band to inside, population std; RSI cross up30/down70; ATR break previous12 high/low +/− .5*prior14 simple true range.','size':'95% of500 budget; SPOT quantity=floor(budget/entrypx) and base fee deducted. SWAP contracts=floor(budget/(ctVal*entrypx*(1/leverage+fee))); contract base qty=contracts*ctVal. No leverage multiplication of spot returns. Specs ctType linear settleUSDT required. Current specs historical validity UNKNOWN.','exit':'After each15m close estimate equity after adverse exit fees. If >=650 or <=250, exit NEXT15m open; actual final net >=650 determines success. Horizon terminal at end boundary uses last closed bar close proxy (conservative fees), not executable quote. No intrabar target fills, no replacement or topup.','funding':'At each observed fundingTime with position held before timestamp, use realizedRate*fixed base qty*SWAP bar open proxy at timestamp, long pays/short receives. Funding before next-open exit, not before new entry. Must be aligned15m; history gaps>8h or missing coverage invalidate derivative episode.','liquidation':'No true mark or historical tiers. Use swap traded OHLC adverse extreme before close target test; if modeled collateral <=abs(qty*adverse_price)*(.02+.002), terminate as MAINTENANCE_PROXY_BREACH and set model equity0. This is an explicitly synthetic conservative loss scenario, NOT exchange liquidation or a true bound. For every derivative episode true_target=true_liquidation=UNKNOWN; no actual-viability promotion.','data_gate':'Never fill missing/unconfirmed/conflicting/invalidOHLC. Any missing/zero-volume bar required by120h warmup or full episode invalidates episode, retains in denominator. No candidate/coin replacement. Funding missing invalidates derivatives.','control':'Per identical product/lev/horizon/cost/coin/start, fixed hash seed50020261006 chooses entry hour uniformly in first half episode; spot long, swaps hash chooses direction. Same ledger; controls not new candidate configurations.','selection':'Freeze at most1 config per(product,horizon), require validation evaluated>=30, all scheduled episodes valid, targets>=3, mean return>0; rank paired target-rate improvement over identical-risk hashed control, tie mean return then id. Save before confirmation. No fallback replacement if no pass. Selection is research shortlist only.','promotion':'Report observed episodes reaching650 separately from repeatability. Repeatability candidate requires confirmation evaluated>=30, invalid=0, targets>=3, mean return>0, and target-rate improvement>0. Also positive improvement in validation. Derivative always conditional only; no proven strategy or profitability claim. No additional tuning this batch.','limits':json.loads((P/'run.json').read_text())}
